OL,5,G0800 Radcliffe and Maconie
OL,6,     FMark and Stuart blast off into
OL,7,     Fspace for Slow Sunday and float
OL,8,     Faround the cosmos with a stellar
OL,9,     Fselection of space-themed tracks
OL,10,     Fand chat.
OL,11,G1000 Bobby Friction
OL,12,     FBobby Friction hosts Slow Sunday
OL,13,     Fwith a live session from FRQNCY
OL,14,     FLDN, the experimental project of
OL,15,     FAlex Lavery and James Ford,
OL,16,     Fproducer and one half of Simian
OL,17,     FMobile Disco.
OL,18,G1300 Guy Garvey's Finest Hour
OL,19,     FGuy celebrates Slow Sunday with a
OL,20,     Fselection of tunes so slow they
OL,21,     Factually stop. Also, a chat with
OL,22,     FMax Pope and Vincent Neff.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/4
