OL,5,G1600 Jarvis Cocker
OL,6,     FJarvis takes us on a journey to
OL,7,     Fthe New England coast courtesy of
OL,8,     Fauthor Elizabeth Strout. There's
OL,9,     Falso a little Venetian soundscape
OL,10,     Fto keep the mellow vibes flowing.
OL,11,G1800 Mary Anne Hobbs
OL,12,     FNorwegian Mexican artist and DJ
OL,13,     FCarmen Villain provides an ambient
OL,14,     Fmix for Slow Sunday and Marina
OL,15,     FHerlop selects her choice for our
OL,16,     FEnd of Days music library.
OL,17,G2000 Stuart Maconie's Freak Zone
OL,18,     FStuart marks Slow Sunday with a
OL,19,     Fspecial autumnal playlist with
OL,20,     Fmusic from Matt Berry, Lee
OL,21,     FHazelwood and the Incredible
OL,22,     FString Band.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG2/4
